["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Does Leopold Have Situational Awareness? volatility drag margin call expected return long/short equity lockup agreement full Kelly\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-11-patrickboyle-天才叙事败给波动率拖累-纸上英雄到破产只需一场婚礼/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">39:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0811</span></div>\n<h2>4倍槓桿押注AI敘事：天才基金死於波動率拖累</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Aschenbrenner 的失敗不是因為不聰明，而是用 4 倍槓桿押注一個高波動 AI 主題，波動率拖累和收益不對稱註定會失控。市場不會獎勵敘事驅動的集中豪賭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 敘事</span><span class=\"tag\">槓桿</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ryan Greenblatt – What happens once AI can automate AI research? recursive self-improvement (RSI) reward hacking grader sandbagging situational awareness sloppocalypse\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-11-dwarkesh-ai-自动化-ai-研发之后-最大的风险不是恶意而是马虎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e56b28ccc889689b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">2:12:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0811</span></div>\n<h2>AI 自動化 AI 研發後，失控不是變壞而是馬虎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ryan Greenblatt 認為 AI R&amp;D 可驗證性足夠高，全自動化後一年內能壓縮四到五年進展；但真正的失控路徑是 reward hacking 被反覆「蓋住」而非 AI 突然變壞，他給到 2040 年發生 takeover 的概率是 35-40%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">遞歸自我改進</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"#251 – The UK&#x27;s former head AI safety scientist on how to solve alignment before superintelligence arrives | Geoffrey Irving scalable oversight ambiguous arguments character training effective field theory data flywheel\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-11-eightythousand-减速应始于现在-超级智能两三年内到来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d12aa87b0cb730e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:02:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0811</span></div>\n<h2>減速窗口已錯過，超級智能兩三年內到來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國前 AI 安全負責人 Geoffrey Irving 認為，全面超級智能將在兩三年內到來，減速的窗口已經錯過；對齊的希望在於可擴展監督、人格研究和理論突破，而不是精確指定效用函數。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span><span class=\"tag\">超級智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"491 埃德蒙·伯克的保守主義與漸進改革思想：從北美、法國到英屬印度 rotten borough virtual representation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-11-cn2aa250-波士顿倾茶不是抗税事件-而是伦敦金融爆雷后的连锁反应/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0811</span></div>\n<h2>波士頓傾茶不是抗稅事件，而是倫敦金融爆雷後的連鎖反應</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">波士頓傾茶不是北美稅負太重引發的抗稅起義，而是倫敦金融危機通過東印度公司這個槓桿向北美轉嫁的一場自救——帝國中樞的一次爆雷，最後點燃了殖民地革命的引信。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">思想史</span><span class=\"tag\">保守主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"284: ENCORE: Screens, Toxic Stress &amp; Staying Connected with Dr. Nadine Burke Harris ACEs toxic stress response buffering caregiving upstander\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-11-asklisa-别站在孩子和屏幕之间-要站在孩子这边/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">47:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0811</span></div>\n<h2>別擋在孩子和屏幕之間，要站在孩子這邊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">毒性應激的真實機制是被暴露時缺少成人緩衝；越能和孩子站同一邊、把技術當共同對手，關係就越能成為數字時代最強的保護。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">屏幕時間</span><span class=\"tag\">毒性應激</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Max Hodak: How Startups Build Speed eigenreviews AI-resistant homework vibe coding tropicalization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-ycsp-深科技公司败给组织系统-而不是技术失败/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5e8b9a2ac9beab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">57:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>深科技公司敗給組織系統，而不是技術失敗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創業公司能多快迭代，決定它能贏多久；而迭代速度來自採購、招人、績效這些「基礎設施」。把審批放到預算層、績效改成 eigenreviews，比糾結具體技術更值得投入。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">組織效率</span><span class=\"tag\">招聘機制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Swing Riots threshing machine flail Corn Laws workhouse select vestries rotten boroughs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-stuffmissed-砸烂打谷机也没能换来工人好日子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>砸爛打穀機換來252個死刑判決，工人卻沒贏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十九世紀英格蘭農民以砸毀打穀機抗議失業，換來的是252人死刑判決、481人或505人流放澳洲，以及1832年有限的議會改革——工人命運沒變，政治版圖變了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">農業革命</span><span class=\"tag\">技術性失業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"What do we actually think about Hyperscale Silicon?? // The AI Hardware Podcast S2E9 TPU Nitro RISC-V Arm CSS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-techtechpotato-超大规模自研芯片-不只为省钱-更怕被-nvidia-绑架/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/430136289cd55797-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">30:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>自研芯片不為省錢，為擺脫 Nvidia 的代際綁架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">超大規模廠商自研芯片的真正動機不是省錢，而是控制權：避免被 Nvidia 的代際節奏綁架，同時靠規模壓縮網絡和計算成本。Broadcom 稅比 Nvidia 稅更便宜，但只有最大玩家玩得起。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">超大規模廠商</span><span class=\"tag\">自研芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"363 | Chandra Sripada on How LLMs and Humans are Cognitive Cousins production system in-weight processing in-context processing contravariance architectural canalization chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-mindscape-预测是训练信号之母-llm-是认知表亲/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:51:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>LLM 不是自動補全，而是人類的認知表親</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LLM 不是花哨的自動補全，而是與人類共享核心認知原則的「認知表親」：注意力機制復現了生產系統，預測是主導訓練信號；樣本效率差三四個數量級，但架構調整可能補上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">認知科學</span><span class=\"tag\">認知表親</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ben Sasse on Faith, Family, and Facing Death Heidelberg Catechism shared governance accelerationism safetyism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-econtalk-把死亡视为最后的敌人而非最终话语/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>死亡是最後的敵人而非最終話語：前參議員借來的時間</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">晚期胰腺癌患者、前參議員 Ben Sasse 在借來的時間裡受訪：腫瘤已縮小超過80%，但可能無法治癒；他把死亡看作「最後的敵人而非最終話語」，並把行政越權的根源指向立法退縮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">胰腺癌</span><span class=\"tag\">死亡觀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"We’re postliterate postliterate secondary orality syllogism epithet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-grayarea-后文字时代-人人都在读-却没人再读长文/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>後文字時代：人人都在讀，卻沒人再讀長文</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國某天讀過書或文章的人，二十年間少了40%；比識字危機更值得警惕的是後文字時代——抽象思維、教育方式與政治傳播，正在隨長篇閱讀一起退場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">後文字時代</span><span class=\"tag\">注意力經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Using AI to Increase Your Intelligence &amp; Enrich Humanity | Dr. Fei-Fei Li ImageNet 空間智能 具身智能 多模態\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-huberman-视觉是智能基石-ai应增强而非取代人的能动性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9e03163dcfb779e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">2:08:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>視覺是智能基石，AI應增強而非取代人的能動性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">視覺是智能的基石；AI 必須增強人的能動性而不是取代它；人類最珍貴的認知，恰恰從未上傳到互聯網。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">視覺</span><span class=\"tag\">ImageNet</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Disney: The Renaissance and the Empire CAPS story reels film rentals multiplane camera\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-acquired-迪士尼帝国由-espn-现金牛买下-也被它拖住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1af0576da27045e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">4:32:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>ESPN 四年利潤買下皮克斯漫威盧卡斯，也拖住了迪士尼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迪士尼三十年的帝國由 VHS 錄像帶和 ESPN 訂閱費兩座現金牛餵養；流媒體讓結構性優勢失效——IP 永生，但舊商業模式不再有。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">現金牛</span><span class=\"tag\">IP 資產</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Naval Revolution: Triumph and Disaster torpedo boat destroyer 30-knotters ram bow engine telegraph rebreather Normand boiler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-historyhit-鱼雷艇用1-的战列舰成本-逼出了驱逐舰兵种/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/71b0d2c1b954a484-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">36:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>撞角撞沉自家驅逐艦：1%成本魚雷艇催生的新兵種</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1908年，一艘380噸驅逐艦在演習中被1萬噸巡洋艦撞沉，35人遇難。這起悲劇背後，是魚雷艇用1%的戰列艦成本顛覆海戰，催生了驅逐艦。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">海軍史</span><span class=\"tag\">驅逐艦</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"695. Elizabeth I vs The Catholics: The Shadow War (Part 5) cautionary towns fireships / hell-burners Politiques War of the Three Henrys\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-09-restishistory-philip-sidney-之死-英雄是被葬礼制造出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0809</span></div>\n<h2>Philip Sidney 死於腿傷，成名於葬禮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英西冷戰轉入熱戰，Philip Sidney 終於在低地戰場迎來成名機會，卻死於一次並不致命的腿傷；讓他成為新教歐洲英雄的，是葬禮而不是戰功。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊麗莎白一世</span><span class=\"tag\">英西戰爭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Dark Fiber Listening Network DAS (Distributed Acoustic Sensing) Dark Fiber OTDR (Optical Time Domain Reflectometry) VSP (Vertical Seismic Profiling) Geophone Rayleigh Scattering\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-09-asianometry-暗光纤正在把海底变成全球最大窃听网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e6062bb8e32bd3b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">20:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0809</span></div>\n<h2>海底光纜正變成全球最大竊聽網：不是間諜，是物理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">分布式聲學傳感（DAS）讓普通光纜變成連續振動監聽器：油氣井勘測、地震監測、鯨魚追蹤、船隻反潛都用同一條技術鏈，海洋正在快速失去隱私。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">暗光纖</span><span class=\"tag\">分布式聲學傳感</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The playbook for building high-talent-density teams | Adam Ward, Head of Talent at Cursor funnel of doom remainder hiring work sample / work trial talent engineer talent density pre-boarding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-09-lennys-招聘漏斗注定招到平庸的人-10x-只存在于团队里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e5f79e19f08aa8b3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0809</span></div>\n<h2>招聘漏斗註定招到平庸的人，10X 只存在於團隊裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把招聘當銷售漏斗，你招到的不是最強的 20%，只是恰好那天回你消息的 20 個人。Adam Ward 說 talent density 是集體屬性，沒有 10X 的個人，只有 10X 的團隊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">招聘</span><span class=\"tag\">人才密度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Shapur I: Rome&#x27;s Greatest Enemy? Shahanshah Ērānšahr Arsacid dynasty\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-09-ancients-沙普尔一世-生擒罗马皇帝的最强宿敌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/185bf0c8eb3903d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0809</span></div>\n<h2>生擒羅馬皇帝的波斯王，其實是羅馬自己養出的敵人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沙普爾一世兩次摧毀羅馬大軍並俘獲皇帝瓦勒良，是羅馬東方最危險的敵人；但他的勝利更多是三世紀危機的果，而非因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">薩珊波斯</span><span class=\"tag\">羅馬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Thinking in Silico: Goodfire CTO Dan Balsam on Concept Manifolds &amp; a $1000/Month ML Research Agent LRH SAE BSF Predictive Data Debugging Affective Circumplex Silico\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-08-cogrev-模型是遗留代码库-可解释性是调试器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/76fca1fe34565d53-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:57:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0808</span></div>\n<h2>模型是遺留代碼庫：可解釋性是調試器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">數據過濾與獎勵塑形其實是同一座山的兩面；模型是可分解的稀疏混合，可解釋性因此能直接干預訓練。Goodfire 用月費 1000 美元的 Silico，把這種調試自動化了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解釋性</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Episode #251 ... You Must Change Your Life, Pt. 2 - The Worlds That Make Us co-immunity symbolic immunity vertical tension base camp anthrotechnics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-08-philosophize-改变人生不是换信念-而是移动你的大本营/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e87b1cc15318e66e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">35:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophize This!</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0808</span></div>\n<h2>改變人生不是換信念，而是搬出你親手搭的賭場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人不是站在世界對面的獨立主體，而是被環境、身體和符號免疫系統共同構成的產物；想改變人生，就要同時改信念、行動與世界，而不是只逼自己「想通」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">斯洛特戴克</span><span class=\"tag\">環境塑造</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"505 – The Battle of Tinchebray Orderic Vitalis Henry of Huntingdon siege castle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-britishhist-亨利一世在坦什布赖靠下马步战加伏兵生擒长兄/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>下馬步戰加伏兵：亨利一世生擒親哥的諾曼底決戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利一世讓騎士下馬步戰，再用隱蔽的第四梯隊側翼伏擊，生擒哥哥羅伯特，終結這場諾曼底爭奪戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀史</span><span class=\"tag\">諾曼底</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Briefing Chat: Is DNA repair the secret to a long life? Whales and mole-rats offer tantalizing hints dormant virus double-strand break CIRBP (cold-inducible RNA-binding protein) Sirt6 Fucoidan NAD+\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-naturepod-长新冠或源于休眠病毒-dna修复或为长寿关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/15a972da91ae970c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">13:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>DNA修復才是長壽關鍵：弓頭鯨的修復蛋白已進入人體試驗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究顯示近半數新冠住院患者體內潛伏病毒被再激活，一年後炎症和細胞損傷更高；而弓頭鯨等長壽動物的共同點不是抑癌基因，而是更強的DNA修復能力，相關藥物已進入人體試驗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">長新冠</span><span class=\"tag\">潛伏病毒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"How to Disagree With Your Kids Without Fighting HEAR framework curiosity sandwich false polarization hedging\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-raisinggh-别只让孩子换位思考-要让他看见你在听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/41f3114355314dc3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">55:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>別教孩子共情，先讓他看見你在聽</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">讓孩子學會好好分歧，關鍵不是教共情或換位思考，而是用語言證明你在聽；HEAR 框架和好奇三明治可以立刻用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子溝通</span><span class=\"tag\">分歧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What does a parent owe their child? PGT-A polygenic testing pleiotropy satisficing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-grayarea-胚胎筛选-父母该为孩子做到哪一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77b28234367aefc8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>篩選胚胎不是盡一切可能，是道德綁架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基因篩選能降低疾病風險，但統計意義常被誇大，且可能加劇社會不平等。父母應追求「足夠好」而非「最優」，警惕商業公司的道德綁架。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基因篩選</span><span class=\"tag\">生育倫理</span>\n</div></div></a>"]